Thanks Tom, this is feasible. We can enable the column co2_kg_per_shipment fo=
r your tenant so that it appears in the export from week 44 (Monday 26 Octobe=
r).

Points to be aware of:
- The calculation covers road legs only, WTW, based on GLEC default emission =
factors per vehicle type and distance.
- As long as carriers do not send actual fuel consumption, the value is an es=
timate based on these defaults.
- Decimal separator is a dot, two decimals, empty value for shipments without=
 a road leg.

I attached a sample export with 5 shipments so Pieter can start on the mappin=
g.

Best regards,
RouteWise Support
TMS software vendor

