Subject: TMS export: CO2 per shipment column from week 44

We want to show CO2 per shipment on the logistics KPI dashboard and would lik=
e to get it straight from the TMS export instead of calculating it in Excel.

Could you add a column co2_kg_per_shipment to the standard shipment export? O=
ur scope:
- road legs only, no sea or rail
- well-to-wheel (WTW), calculated according to the GLEC framework
- value in kg, per shipment

Pieter Bakker (in cc) maintains the dashboard mapping and needs a sample file=
 before he can change anything. Our target is that the column is in the expor=
t from week 44. Is that realistic on your side?

Kind regards,
